{"path":"concepts/swappable","title":"std::swappable, std::swappable_with","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>swappable, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>swappable_with","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/concepts/swappable","section":"concepts","kind":"page","summary":"The concept swappable<T> specifies that lvalues of type T are swappable.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/concepts\">&lt;concepts&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>concept swappable <span class=\"sy1\">=</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; requires<span class=\"br0\">(</span>T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> a, T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> b<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/ranges/swap\"><span class=\"kw2874\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">swap</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>a, b<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> U <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>concept swappable_with <span class=\"sy1\">=</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/common_reference_with\"><span class=\"kw2954\">std::<span class=\"me2\">common_reference_with</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T, U<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; requires<span class=\"br0\">(</span>T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> t, U<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> u<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/ranges/swap\"><span class=\"kw2874\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">swap</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>t<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>t<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/ranges/swap\"><span class=\"kw2874\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">swap</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>U<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>u<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>U<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>u<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/ranges/swap\"><span class=\"kw2874\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">swap</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>t<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>U<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>u<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/ranges/swap\"><span class=\"kw2874\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">swap</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>U<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>u<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>t<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The concept <code>swappable&lt;T&gt;</code> specifies that lvalues of type <code>T</code> are swappable.\n</p><p>The concept <code>swappable_with&lt;T, U&gt;</code> specifies that expressions of the type and value category encoded by <code>T</code> and <code>U</code> are swappable with each other. <code>swappable_with&lt;T, U&gt;</code> is satisfied only if a call to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/ranges/swap\"><span class=\"kw2874\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">swap</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>t, u<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> exchanges the value of <code>t</code> and <code>u</code>, that is, given distinct objects <code>t2</code> equal to <code>t</code> and <code>u2</code> equal to <code>u</code>, after evaluating either <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/ranges/swap\"><span class=\"kw2874\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">swap</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>t, u<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/ranges/swap\"><span class=\"kw2874\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">swap</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>u, t<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, <code>t2</code> is equal to <code>u</code> and <code>u2</code> is equal to <code>t</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Equality_preservation\">Equality preservation</h3>\n<p>Expressions declared in <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/requires\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">requires</span> expressions</a> of the standard library concepts are required to be <a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts#Equality_preservation\">equality-preserving</a> (except where stated otherwise).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c++23\">\n<ul><li> C++23 standard (ISO/IEC 14882:2024): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 18.4.9 Concept <code>swappable</code> [concept.swappable] \n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c++20\">\n<ul><li> C++20 standard (ISO/IEC 14882:2020): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 18.4.9 Concept <code>swappable</code> [concept.swappable] \n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Equality preservation","id":"Equality_preservation"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"concepts","title":"Concepts library (since C++20)"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::swappable, std::swappable_with","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++20. The concept swappable<T> specifies that lvalues of type T are swappable."},{"label":"Equality preservation","note":"Expressions declared in requires expressions of the standard library concepts are required to be equality-preserving (except where stated otherwise)."},{"label":"References"}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":172,"codeBlockCount":0}
